<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Unemployment, wholesale sales.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Unemployment, wholesale sales.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Wholesales sales  Dec, 1996    -1.4 m/m		  5-6 Feb</p>
<p> Unemployment	Jan	    adj 4.2 million	     6 Feb</p>
<p>NOTE - Unemployment data would be released by the Labour Ministry and wholesale sales by the the Federal Statistics Office, which said the expected release dates for wholesale sales were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
